g source must be FDA/openFDA instead of DailyMed, adverse-event percentages include unsupported/incorrect dizziness, rash, and QT values, filter_enzyme_effect should be Inducer, filter_metabolism should reflect carboxylesterase hydrolysis/no major CYP metabolism, and evidence_sources should be replaced with trusted sources that actually support the retained facts."}
